{
  "pid": "self-hard-07",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "title": "串级 PI 手自动无扰切换（积分预置 + 切换拍保持）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，实现温度-流量串级 PI 控制的三模式无扰切换。\n控制要求：\n1. mode：0=手动、1=外环手动/内环自动、2=串级全自动；mode 不在 0..2、dt<=0 或 dt>10 判 fault；\n2. 初始化、复位上升沿、fault 三者的当拍：flowSP = manualFlowSP、valveCommand = manualValve，并把积分项预置为无扰值：iT = flowSP - KpT*(tempSP-tempPV)，iF = valveCommand - KpF*(flowSP-flowPV)（KpT=1.0，KpF=2.0）；\n3. **模式切换的当拍不做积分**：阀位保持上一拍；切到 mode=2 时 flowSP 也保持上一拍，切到其它模式时 flowSP 跟 manualFlowSP；切换拍同时按上面公式重算 iT、iF；\n4. 正常运算拍（normalMode=TRUE）：\n   mode=0：flowSP=manualFlowSP、valveCommand=manualValve，重算 iT、iF；\n   mode=1：flowSP=manualFlowSP、iT 按公式跟踪；eF=flowSP-flowPV，iF += KiF*eF*dt（KiF=0.5），valveCommand=clamp(KpF*eF+iF,0,100)，随后 iF=valveCommand-KpF*eF；\n   mode=2：eT=tempSP-tempPV，iT += KiT*eT*dt（KiT=0.2），flowSP=clamp(KpT*eT+iT,0,50)，iT=flowSP-KpT*eT；再按 mode=1 的公式算内环；\n5. 模式切换的识别：非初始化拍比较 mode 与内部上一模式；即使连续两拍切换也必须识别；初始化记录当前 mode；下一合法非复位拍 mode 未变则正常运算（与 q2 一致），mode 变化则切换保持；\n6. normalMode 输出：本拍按正常 PI 规则运算则为 TRUE，初始化/切换/故障拍为 FALSE。调用方保证 manualFlowSP 在 [0,50]、manualValve 在 [0,100]；输入均为有限数。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "mode",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "0=手动 1=外环手动/内环自动 2=串级全自动",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resetBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "复位（上升沿）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "dt",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "本周期时长（s），合法 0 < dt <= 10",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "tempSP",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度设定（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "tempPV",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度测量（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "flowPV",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "流量测量（t/h）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "manualFlowSP",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "流量设定手操值（t/h）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "manualValve",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "阀位手操值（%）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "flowSP",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "流量设定输出（t/h），钳位 0..50",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "valveCommand",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "阀位命令（%），钳位 0..100",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fault",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "模式或参数非法",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "normalMode",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "本拍按正常 PI 规则运算（非初始化/切换拍）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "流量设定输出恒在 0..50 t/h 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((flowSP >= 0.0) & (flowSP <= 50.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "阀位命令恒在 0..100 % 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((valveCommand >= 0.0) & (valveCommand <= 100.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "模式切换的当拍阀位命令必须保持上一拍（无扰切换的核心）。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(normalMode) & !normalMode & !rising(resetBtn) & !fault) -> valveCommand = prev(valveCommand))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "切入串级模式的当拍，流量设定必须保持上一拍值。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(normalMode) & !normalMode & mode = 2 & !rising(resetBtn) & !fault) -> flowSP = prev(flowSP))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "故障拍退回无扰跟踪：流量设定跟手操、阀位跟手操。",
      "ltl": "G(fault -> (flowSP = manualFlowSP & valveCommand = manualValve))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "text": "正常运算拍必须处于合法模式且无故障。",
      "ltl": "G(normalMode -> (!fault & mode >= 0 & mode <= 2))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "text": "积分项递推与无扰预置（内环/外环）。",
      "ltl": "",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "simulation"
    }
  ],
